grund.toml is read as version 2.

front-matter-heading
A heading claims the front-matter field's coordinate in a declaration whose kind reads that field from the file's front matter.

Severity: error, fixed.
On: when [schema.kinds.<kind>.fields.front-matter] is set (a setting)
Fix: rename the section
Note: The heading declares nothing, so it is no section and no rule unit.

Next: grund config explain '[schema.kinds.<kind>.fields.front-matter]'
